[TITLE]
CRASH-28: reservoir R1 supplies 1000 gpm to J1 through GPV V1
V1's curve C1 has two points; C2 is a one-point curve that no GPV may use.

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand
 J1   0     1000

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head
 R1   100

[VALVES]
;ID  N1  N2  Diam  Type  Setting
 V1  R1  J1  12    GPV   C1

[CURVES]
;ID  Flow (gpm)  HeadLoss (ft)
 C1  0           0
 C1  2000        20
 C2  500         10       ; one point only

[TIMES]
 Duration  0

[OPTIONS]
 Units     GPM
 Headloss  H-W

[END]
